ton>About Us</button></li><li class="text-text-secondary cursor-pointer"><button>Newsroom</button></li><li class="text-text-secondary cursor-pointer"><button>Contact Us</button></li></ul></nav></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6"><a class="text-[#E3E5E885] max-sm:hidden" href="https://trade.cicada.io/">Login</a><div class="grid cursor-pointer grid-flow-col items-center gap-[1px] rounded-full h-fit w-fit whitespace-nowrap p-[10px_20px] font-medium bg-secondary-accent-3 text-background-foreground">Book a demo<div class="icon-wrap flex w-fit items-center justify-center"><svg width="16px" height="16px" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M7.51144 4.28229L6.51562 5.2781L9.75025 8.51979L6.51562 11.7615L7.51144 12.7573L11.7489 8.51979L7.51144 4.28229Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></div></div><div class="lg:hidden"><button><div class="icon-wrap flex w-fit items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M4 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M4 18H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></header><div class="grid gap-20 overflow-hidden p-[120px_32px] max-sm:p-[16px]"><section class="m-auto grid max-w-[800px] gap-[12px] w-[90%] !max-w-[1355px] md:w-[80%] lg:w-[90%]" id="Live prices"><div class="my-[5px]"><div class="w-fit bg-gradient-to-r from-[#4EEAB9] to-[#4B48DD] bg-clip-text text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-transparent">Live prices</div><div class="mb-[24px] mt-[12px] text-[40px] font-medium leading-[42px] max-sm:text-[36px] max-sm:leading-[44px]"><h2>Pre-Trade Transparency for Better Execution</h2></div><div class=" text-[18px] font-medium text-text-secondary"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><p class="text-lg text-text-secondary">We know that real-time quotes, volumes and market depth are very valuable for market participants because it facilitates price discovery and price formation in the market, thereby promoting best execution. This is why Cicada makes available, for the first-time ever, access to complete and real-time pre-trade data (accurate pricing data and firm orders) to all participants trading in local-currency fixed-income.</p><p class="text-base text-text-tertiary">Please take note that this page is updated with a certain delay so the data displayed isn&#x27;t real-time. To access live data, please book a demo with our team.</p></div></div></div></section><div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] border border-[#FFFFFF1A] p-[36px_32px] max-sm:gap-[16px] max-sm:rounded-none max-sm:border-0 max-sm:p-0"><div class="grid p-[12px] max-sm:p-0"></div><div class="grid gap-[8px] overflow-hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-[min-content_1fr_max-content] items-center gap-[8px] border-t border-blue-100 bg-blue-800 p-[16px] text-blue-100 max-sm:grid-cols-[min-content_1fr] max-sm:items-start"><div class="icon-wrap flex w-fit items-center justify-center"><svg width="16px" height="16px" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 1C7.08075 1 6.17049 1.18106 5.32122 1.53284C4.47194 1.88463 3.70026 2.40024 3.05025 3.05025C1.7375 4.36301 1 6.14348 1 8C1 9.85651 1.7375 11.637 3.05025 12.9497C3.70026 13.5998 4.47194 14.1154 5.32122 14.4672C6.17049 14.8189 7.08075 15 8 15C9.85651 15 11.637 14.2625 12.9497 12.9497C14.2625 11.637 15 9.85651 15 8C15 7.08075 14.8189 6.17049 14.4672 5.32122C14.1154 4.47194 13.5998 3.70026 12.9497 3.05025C12.2997 2.40024 11.5281 1.88463 10.6788 1.53284C9.8295 1.18106 8.91925 1 8 1ZM10.94 10.94L7.3 8.7V4.5H8.35V8.14L11.5 10.03L10.94 10.94Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="grid gap-[4px] text-[12px]"><div class="font-semibold">Market Data Delay</div><div>Please be aware that the information displayed on this page is not in real time and may experience a delay. To access real‒time data, please book a demo with our team.</div></div><div class="grid justify-end max-sm:col-span-2"><div class="grid cursor-pointer grid-flow-col items-center gap-[1px] rounded-full h-fit w-fit whitespace-nowrap p-[10px_20px] font-medium bg-neutrals-700 text-[#D2D4D7]">Book a demo<div class="icon-wrap flex w-fit items-center justify-center"><svg width="16px" height="16px" viewBox="0 0 17 17" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M7.51144 4.28229L6.51562 5.2781L9.75025 8.51979L6.51562 11.7615L7.51144 12.7573L11.7489 8.51979L7.51144 4.28229Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden max-sm:hidden"><div class="overflow-auto"><table role="table" class="w-full"><thead><tr role="row"><th colSpan="1" role="columnheader" class="border-b border-border-1 bg-background-accent p-[14px_16px] font-medium text-text-secondary"><div class="grid grid-flow-col justify-between"><div>Security Name</div></div></th><th colSpan="1" role="columnheader" class="border-b border-border-1 bg-background-accent p-[14px_16px] font-medium text-text-secondary"><div class="grid grid-flow-col justify-between"><div>ISIN</div></div></th><th colSpan="1" role="columnheader" class="border-b border-border-1 bg-background-accent p-[14px_16px] font-medium text-text-secondary"><div class="grid grid-flow-col justify-between"><div><div class="grid w-fit grid-flow-col gap-[4px] whitespace-nowrap">Best Bid<div class="text-text-tertiary">(<!-- -->Price<!-- -->)</div></div></div></div></th><th colSpan="1" role="columnheader" class="border-b border-border-1 bg-background-accent p-[14px_16px] font-medium text-text-secondary"><div class="grid grid-flow-col justify-between"><div><div class="grid w-fit grid-flow-col gap-[4px] whitespace-nowrap">Best Bid<div class="text-